1.  ONE IMP RULE IN BFS =  PUSH STARTING POINTS IN QUEUE 
2.  THEN till the QUEUE IS NOT GETTING EMPTY KEEP ON POPPING THE FRONT ELEMENT ND CHECK THE NEIGHBOURS FOR BFS .
